#. i18n: file: audiocdconfig.ui:143
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, ec_enable_check)
#: rc.cpp:30
msgid "Use &error correction when reading the CD"
msgstr "Gebruik &fout korreksie wanneer die CD gelees word"

#. i18n: file: audiocdconfig.ui:149
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, ec_enable_check)
#: rc.cpp:33
msgid ""
"If you uncheck this option, the slave will not try to use error correction "
"which can be useful for reading damaged CDs. However, this feature can be "
"problematic in some cases, so you can switch it off here."
msgstr "As jy hierdie opsie ontkies, sal die slaaf probeer om nie fout korreksie te gebruik nie. Dit is voordelig om beskadigde CDs te lees. Let wel dat dit probleme kan veroorsaak in party gevalle en jy kan dit hier afsit."

